      "name": "New York City",
      "type": "Place",
      "isolated_context": "The NYSME was originally incorporated in 1926 in this city. The Society operated in various locations throughout Manhattan during its early years. Central Park is a location within New York City where the Society obtained a permit for model motor boat races."
